Generate the autocompletion script for flate for the specified shell.
See each sub-command's help for details on how to use the generated script.

Usage:
  flate completion [command]

Available Commands:
  bash        Generate the autocompletion script for bash
  fish        Generate the autocompletion script for fish
  powershell  Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
  zsh         Generate the autocompletion script for zsh

Flags:
  -h, --help[=true|false]   help for completion

Global Flags:
      --log-level string           Set log level: debug,info,warn,error [env: FLATE_LOG_LEVEL] (default "error")
      --no-progress[=true|false]   Hide live progress on stderr [env: FLATE_NO_PROGRESS]

Use "flate completion [command] --help" for more information about a command.
